WEBVTT

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:11.860
MOBILE SUIT
<b>GUNDAM
VICTORY</b>

00:01:24.860 --> 00:01:27.260
In a battle on the lunar surface,

00:01:27.300 --> 00:01:30.460
not only was Üso's mother captured,

00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:33.760
but Oliver Inoe rammed his fighter...

00:01:33.800 --> 00:01:37.100
...into an enemy warship and was lost.

00:01:38.130 --> 00:01:41.900
However, with the Reineforce Junior in pursuit...

00:01:41.930 --> 00:01:45.200
...of the Earth bound Motorad space fleet,

00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:49.260
Marbet was given no time to grieve.

00:01:50.200 --> 00:01:52.660
DOGGORLA'S VIOLENT ADVANCE

00:01:52.660 --> 00:01:55.560
"Doggorla's Violent Advance".

00:02:07.260 --> 00:02:08.700
Adrastea, entering!

00:02:08.830 --> 00:02:11.960
Dock personnel, deploy mobile suits at once!

00:02:12.160 --> 00:02:14.230
Begin repair work, at once!

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:24.000
Mounting a new front radd should take half a day.

00:02:24.030 --> 00:02:27.130
But, this will allow the League Militaire to catch up to us.

00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:30.560
The Federation Forces don't seem to be moving yet. What about...

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:34.260
We've prepared something to counter the League Militaire.

00:02:34.460 --> 00:02:37.760
I'll leave the preparations to you then, old friend.

00:02:37.860 --> 00:02:41.760
A machine and a man capable of destroying a battleship.

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:43.300
Enter, Brogh.

00:02:43.430 --> 00:02:44.160
Sir!

00:02:45.730 --> 00:02:49.700
Allow me to show these women and children what real battle is!

00:02:49.830 --> 00:02:51.160
This man...

00:02:51.460 --> 00:02:56.100
Don't be overconfident. They may send the white one out after you.

00:02:56.260 --> 00:02:58.260
I understand what you're saying,

00:02:58.300 --> 00:03:01.730
but you'll be a bit more confident when you see the Doggorla.

00:03:02.330 --> 00:03:03.530
I'll sortie at once!

00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:05.030
A mobile armor?

00:03:05.060 --> 00:03:07.930
Similar, but with a slight difference.

00:03:10.060 --> 00:03:12.360
He said he's testing it out in a live battle?

00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:15.700
Leave it to him. This thing's special.

00:03:15.900 --> 00:03:18.300
Be careful not to hit the Marilyn! You're go for launch!

00:03:18.330 --> 00:03:19.160
Roger.

00:03:19.460 --> 00:03:21.500
Does such a young fleet commander...

00:03:21.530 --> 00:03:25.100
...understand the real power of the Motorad Fleet?

00:03:26.260 --> 00:03:29.130
Operations Chief Pippiniden! Doggorla, moving out!

00:03:29.160 --> 00:03:29.930
Right!

00:03:37.100 --> 00:03:38.100
This is it?

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:40.200
If this is mass produced,

00:03:40.230 --> 00:03:42.660
we'll be able to destroy the Earth Federation, as well!

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:43.700
Hm?

00:03:44.730 --> 00:03:46.360
It doesn't seem to be working properly.

00:03:46.400 --> 00:03:50.200
No, sir. Please look at the segment now on the upper monitor.

00:03:52.130 --> 00:03:54.500
It can jettison damaged segments in battle,

00:03:54.530 --> 00:03:57.030
and then reattach itself.

00:03:57.100 --> 00:03:57.930
Commandant!

00:03:58.430 --> 00:04:01.030
Please allow me to launch, so that I can learn...

00:04:01.060 --> 00:04:03.000
...from the Doggorla's fighting techniques.

00:04:03.030 --> 00:04:06.230
I see. I'll allow it, for future use.

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:07.000
Yes, sir!

00:04:22.600 --> 00:04:24.730
We will now commence sequential landing training.

00:04:24.830 --> 00:04:26.000
Üso will go first,

00:04:26.030 --> 00:04:28.900
followed by Odelo, and then Tomáš.

00:04:29.130 --> 00:04:31.160
Keep out of the way of the unit trailing you.

00:04:31.260 --> 00:04:32.100
Understood?

00:04:32.130 --> 00:04:34.430
Understood. Commencing landing.

00:04:39.100 --> 00:04:41.430
It's starting to feel like the old Victory.

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:43.360
Hold your machine level!

00:04:44.930 --> 00:04:46.700
Gentler at the apogee!

00:04:46.730 --> 00:04:48.500
If you say so, but...

00:04:55.760 --> 00:04:57.000
You okay, Odelo?

00:04:57.030 --> 00:04:59.460
Always concerned for your seniors. I appreciate that!

00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:02.060
I-I can't stop!

00:05:13.260 --> 00:05:15.000
All right, Goz Barl? We're moving out.

00:05:15.030 --> 00:05:16.000
Right, go ahead.

00:05:16.030 --> 00:05:16.930
Okay.

00:05:21.330 --> 00:05:24.200
Just try to stay out of the way.

00:05:26.960 --> 00:05:30.400
One of the Motorad space fleet's ships has definitely stopped.

00:05:30.430 --> 00:05:33.030
And we're going to launch an air raid, right?

00:05:33.400 --> 00:05:36.160
You want a battle to avenge Oliver and the others, right?

00:05:36.200 --> 00:05:37.330
Of course.

00:05:37.360 --> 00:05:40.630
I was hoping to bring Odelo and Tomáš with me. Is that all right?

00:05:40.830 --> 00:05:44.300
Those kids have come this far. We can't say no now, can we?

00:05:44.330 --> 00:05:48.200
They're not as good as Üso, but they seem to be picking it up.

00:05:48.230 --> 00:05:52.200
They've already had mock combat training, and I'll be there as support.

00:05:52.800 --> 00:05:55.230
All right. They're your responsibility.

00:05:55.260 --> 00:05:56.660
Aye, sir! Then I'll go.

00:05:58.360 --> 00:06:01.660
If we don't let her do as she likes, she'll never snap out of this mood.

00:06:01.700 --> 00:06:03.330
Still...

00:06:03.730 --> 00:06:05.730
As soon as Shrike Unit 1 launches,

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:08.960
launch Shrike Unit 2 and then Marbet's unit.

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:11.860
This is Victory 2, spearhead of Marbet's unit.

00:06:12.660 --> 00:06:15.400
Üso Ewin, V2 Gundam, here I go!

00:06:21.430 --> 00:06:23.200
Will Odelo and the others catch up?

00:06:23.400 --> 00:06:25.530
Okay? Don't go out too far.

00:06:25.560 --> 00:06:26.300
Right! Right!

00:06:26.560 --> 00:06:28.730
Marbet, Hexa, moving out!

00:06:30.230 --> 00:06:33.700
This may be me showing off, but... Tomáš, I'm headed out first!

00:06:33.730 --> 00:06:34.530
Please.

00:06:35.300 --> 00:06:38.030
Marbet unit, Gun Blaster 5, here I go!

00:06:38.060 --> 00:06:39.200
Who is that?

00:06:39.600 --> 00:06:40.860
Odelo Henrik, sir.

00:06:40.900 --> 00:06:41.560
Okay!

00:06:41.600 --> 00:06:42.500
Here I go!

00:06:45.030 --> 00:06:47.500
Gun Blaster 6, Tomáš, here I go!

00:06:53.400 --> 00:06:55.830
So many mobile suits are going out.

00:06:56.160 --> 00:06:58.660
You think Odelo and Tomáš have flown out, too?

00:06:58.700 --> 00:07:00.900
Of course not. They're still in training, right?

00:07:01.860 --> 00:07:03.400
And you, quit squirming!

00:07:06.160 --> 00:07:08.830
The boosters they mounted don't make much difference.

00:07:08.860 --> 00:07:09.830
These will...

00:07:10.260 --> 00:07:12.430
The forward Shrike Team is already engaging!

00:07:17.130 --> 00:07:20.800
Hasn't Tomáš noticed? 11 o'clock, high!

00:07:23.130 --> 00:07:25.100
Okay, okay, as long as he knows.

00:07:25.630 --> 00:07:27.900
Which means, they'll be coming here, soon!

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:31.500
The enemy was already set to intercept us?

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:34.300
Confirm rendezvous point!

00:07:34.330 --> 00:07:35.400
Radio silence!

00:07:35.560 --> 00:07:38.860
Scatter Minovsky particles. Got that, Odelo, Tomáš?

00:07:38.900 --> 00:07:39.630
Roger!

00:07:39.900 --> 00:07:41.930
If you get confused, fall back to the rendezvous point.

00:07:41.960 --> 00:07:42.860
They're here!

00:07:47.260 --> 00:07:48.960
They fired their beams too soon!

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:50.800
Because they sent out women and children!

00:07:52.830 --> 00:07:54.860
The enemy's nervous, too.

00:07:55.230 --> 00:07:57.230
Tomáš, Odelo, stay with me!

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:02.200
I-I don't know where I should look!

00:08:02.230 --> 00:08:04.830
At this rate, we're just going to get killed!

00:08:07.230 --> 00:08:08.330
I have you!

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:10.100
Odelo! Tomáš!

00:08:17.630 --> 00:08:20.060
Miss Marbet's got them covered.

00:08:20.760 --> 00:08:22.660
I've never seen a machine like that!

00:08:23.860 --> 00:08:26.500
Whoever's in that machine isn't playing around!

00:08:35.260 --> 00:08:37.400
You dodge around like a rat!

00:08:37.430 --> 00:08:39.830
Let me show you how I use the Doggorla!

00:08:43.060 --> 00:08:45.600
The bigger you are, the easier it is to hit you!

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:50.700
See? Trying to scare me with your looks!

00:08:50.730 --> 00:08:51.500
What?!

00:09:03.860 --> 00:09:06.160
Do I have to smash its head, then?!

00:09:13.030 --> 00:09:14.930
Can the Doggorla finish him?

00:09:16.830 --> 00:09:17.930
Fall!

00:09:24.360 --> 00:09:28.030
We can't attack the Motorad space fleet while dealing with this!

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:36.260
BESPA isn't as soft as we thought!

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:38.160
Who just got killed?

00:09:42.330 --> 00:09:43.760
Tomáš! Odelo!

00:09:56.730 --> 00:09:58.360
M-Miss Marbet!

00:09:58.400 --> 00:09:59.700
She did it!

00:10:01.800 --> 00:10:04.830
Did I use those children as my shield?!

00:10:06.300 --> 00:10:07.360
Thank you!

00:10:07.560 --> 00:10:08.760
You saved us.

00:10:09.230 --> 00:10:10.730
Stay on my tail!

00:10:10.760 --> 00:10:11.630
Yes, ma'am! Yes, ma'am!

00:10:15.160 --> 00:10:17.960
What? The Adrastea's leaving the Marilyn?

00:10:18.360 --> 00:10:21.730
But we just got the front radd on! What should we do?

00:10:22.300 --> 00:10:24.460
So, then what's the problem?

00:10:24.700 --> 00:10:26.100
There is no problem.

00:10:26.200 --> 00:10:28.430
Right, we'll do the final assembly...

00:10:28.460 --> 00:10:31.960
...and adjustment of the front radd as we head to Earth.

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:34.600
Take the mechanics we'll need aboard the ship.

00:10:35.200 --> 00:10:37.130
We can't even use our machine guns...

00:10:37.160 --> 00:10:39.100
...while we're still docked with the Marilyn.

00:10:39.130 --> 00:10:41.630
Yes, sir. We need to rendezvous with...

00:10:41.660 --> 00:10:44.330
...the Motorad space fleet that's gone on ahead.

00:10:44.700 --> 00:10:46.900
It's the right call, Commandant.

00:10:54.300 --> 00:10:55.300
Dammit!

00:10:57.400 --> 00:10:58.430
Gotcha!

00:11:00.330 --> 00:11:02.160
That fake dragon's here!

00:11:02.460 --> 00:11:03.860
Brogh, thanks!

00:11:04.130 --> 00:11:06.860
That's why I wanted to do this on my own!

00:11:07.230 --> 00:11:08.660
This is wasting my time!

00:11:08.700 --> 00:11:10.660
You... You... Fall!

00:11:10.700 --> 00:11:12.160
Odelo, you're in too deep!

00:11:12.200 --> 00:11:13.030
Y-Yes, ma'am!

00:11:14.130 --> 00:11:16.400
Odelo, you're using too much power!

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:30.630
I won't let you guys drift away!

00:11:33.130 --> 00:11:36.360
I used these kids as a shield again!

00:12:00.430 --> 00:12:04.400
The flare signaling our mobile suits to retreat has been fired, sir.

00:12:04.630 --> 00:12:05.730
Right!

00:12:05.760 --> 00:12:10.100
Adrastea, set course for Earth! Rear turrets, maintain air watch!

00:12:14.230 --> 00:12:15.460
We're ordered to return?

00:12:15.930 --> 00:12:18.330
They completed the repairs already?

00:12:18.960 --> 00:12:20.560
Team leader Katejina Loos!

00:12:20.760 --> 00:12:23.430
I'll fly rear cover. Please, return to the ship.

00:12:24.330 --> 00:12:26.330
But, Ensign Goz Barl...

00:12:26.360 --> 00:12:28.800
We should let the Doggorla handle this skirmish.

00:12:29.460 --> 00:12:32.430
Conquest of the Earth takes priority!

00:12:32.460 --> 00:12:34.100
Right. Falling back!

00:12:38.860 --> 00:12:39.500
What?!

00:12:39.530 --> 00:12:41.160
The dragon's coming from the moon!

00:12:41.200 --> 00:12:42.030
The moon?!

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:47.830
Miss Marbet!

00:12:50.700 --> 00:12:51.930
Little rat!

00:12:55.930 --> 00:12:57.130
I can do this!

00:12:57.560 --> 00:12:58.560
Tomáš!

00:13:03.060 --> 00:13:04.130
Why, you!

00:13:06.230 --> 00:13:07.600
Thanks, Tomáš.

00:13:07.630 --> 00:13:09.360
We can handle this!

00:13:09.400 --> 00:13:11.060
Look out, Miss Marbet!

00:13:15.260 --> 00:13:16.460
Odelo!

00:13:16.900 --> 00:13:18.560
What?! Odelo's been...

00:13:21.730 --> 00:13:26.000
Miss Marbet's still shaken from losing Mr. Oliver!

00:13:26.560 --> 00:13:28.460
She's just working herself into a panic!

00:13:28.630 --> 00:13:29.630
Odelo!

00:13:34.060 --> 00:13:35.830
I've drawn the enemy here!

00:13:38.600 --> 00:13:40.300
You're not getting away!

00:13:46.100 --> 00:13:47.760
We're way outgunned here!

00:13:47.800 --> 00:13:49.560
We can't get any closer!

00:13:50.030 --> 00:13:54.260
What the hell is Shrike Team 1 doing getting lured out there?!

00:13:55.030 --> 00:13:56.630
Is that an enemy resupply ship?

00:13:57.700 --> 00:14:01.030
The Marilyn, huh? A pure dock ship.

00:14:03.930 --> 00:14:05.630
What's wrong with this thing?

00:14:06.030 --> 00:14:07.400
This one's fine, too.

00:14:08.130 --> 00:14:10.630
What the hell is that ship thing?!

00:14:10.760 --> 00:14:12.460
It... It's huge!

00:14:18.530 --> 00:14:20.100
An enemy mobile suit!

00:14:21.800 --> 00:14:24.160
A-Are you kidding me?!

00:14:24.430 --> 00:14:26.730
I'm in the enemy's ship!

00:14:33.430 --> 00:14:34.360
It's not moving.

00:14:34.400 --> 00:14:36.030
The arm's damaged.

00:14:36.060 --> 00:14:37.930
It's not gonna explode, right?

00:14:37.960 --> 00:14:39.960
We can operate it! Let's steal it!

00:14:40.300 --> 00:14:42.230
Crap! Here comes another one!

00:14:43.930 --> 00:14:46.600
Evacuate! Prepare to engage!

00:14:46.660 --> 00:14:47.730
One at a time!

00:14:47.760 --> 00:14:49.230
Where are the rifles?!

00:14:56.230 --> 00:14:58.000
Odelo! You're alive, right?

00:15:00.160 --> 00:15:01.860
Odelo! Odelo!

00:15:04.700 --> 00:15:07.100
Not good. Is he having a seizure?

00:15:07.260 --> 00:15:08.330
Odelo!

00:15:10.400 --> 00:15:13.330
If he doesn't snap out of it, he'll bite his tongue off!

00:15:13.530 --> 00:15:14.560
Is there something...?

00:15:19.700 --> 00:15:21.600
Dummy balloons won't stop me!

00:15:25.160 --> 00:15:27.060
Those dummies are rigged to explode!

00:15:30.960 --> 00:15:33.630
Enough! Get back to the Reineforce Junior!

00:15:33.760 --> 00:15:35.330
But, what about Odelo?!

00:15:40.400 --> 00:15:42.160
If we steal it undamaged...

00:15:42.200 --> 00:15:44.460
We can study Victory's abilities!

00:15:44.600 --> 00:15:46.930
Jam its joints with anything you can!

00:15:51.200 --> 00:15:53.300
Hurry up and get the crane over here!

00:15:53.330 --> 00:15:54.600
Hurry!

00:15:55.100 --> 00:15:57.100
This machine's still new!

00:15:57.360 --> 00:15:59.260
You mean it's not the Victory?

00:16:02.460 --> 00:16:03.500
Odelo...

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:11.560
Üso! Why are you here?

00:16:13.900 --> 00:16:15.360
Are you okay?

00:16:15.660 --> 00:16:18.830
What are you trying to feed me in the middle of a battle?!

00:16:18.860 --> 00:16:20.800
Can you close the main nozzle?

00:16:20.830 --> 00:16:24.400
Don't! Once we capture the pilot, we can test it right away.

00:16:24.430 --> 00:16:25.600
Seriously?

00:16:25.630 --> 00:16:26.600
Try it.

00:16:26.630 --> 00:16:27.330
Right.

00:16:29.630 --> 00:16:30.900
It's moving!

00:16:32.260 --> 00:16:33.760
The pilot's alive!

00:16:33.800 --> 00:16:35.160
My elbow's broken.

00:16:36.400 --> 00:16:37.830
I'll pull you out.

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:38.860
Please!

00:16:41.860 --> 00:16:43.000
What's all this?

00:16:43.800 --> 00:16:45.500
All this garbage...

00:16:46.260 --> 00:16:47.260
A ladle?

00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:49.160
Üso, I think it's okay!

00:16:57.000 --> 00:17:00.060
Dammit, we had those enemy mobile suits right here!

00:17:00.100 --> 00:17:01.600
And there they go.

00:17:08.160 --> 00:17:10.560
After everything, that enemy ship will get away!

00:17:13.060 --> 00:17:14.800
Odelo, you're okay!

00:17:17.630 --> 00:17:20.060
You can't see me when I'm right next to your chest!

00:17:22.560 --> 00:17:23.560
What?!

00:17:27.930 --> 00:17:31.160
If I grab on and smash your head...

00:17:39.360 --> 00:17:40.760
Damned rats!

00:17:46.760 --> 00:17:48.030
Rat!

00:18:07.030 --> 00:18:08.000
Üso.

00:18:08.760 --> 00:18:10.830
Miss Marbet, it's over.

00:18:11.230 --> 00:18:13.630
That BESPA ship's already left.

00:18:14.460 --> 00:18:16.430
Our raid's a failure.

00:18:17.160 --> 00:18:18.330
Let's retreat.

00:18:19.660 --> 00:18:21.430
Right, let's retreat.

00:18:28.630 --> 00:18:31.960
Oliver, I'm no good. This whole thing's a mess.

00:18:40.030 --> 00:18:42.560
Miss Marbet, the way you were fighting today...

00:18:42.630 --> 00:18:44.200
I'll make no excuses!

00:18:45.160 --> 00:18:48.860
I fought using Odelo and Tomáš as shields!

00:18:49.260 --> 00:18:53.060
I didn't mean to, but it was the only way I could move!

00:18:54.330 --> 00:18:56.130
You're wrong.

00:18:57.500 --> 00:19:02.500
Odelo and Tomáš are pilots that Mr. Oliver left behind for us.

00:19:02.960 --> 00:19:07.360
And those two did what Mr. Oliver would have done.

00:19:12.100 --> 00:19:13.230
Oliver...

00:19:18.160 --> 00:19:25.200
Please tell me what... oshiete anata ga

00:19:25.230 --> 00:19:30.830
...you kept on talking about kataritsuzuketa koto

00:19:32.300 --> 00:19:33.330
This is Mr. Oliver?

00:19:33.360 --> 00:19:33.560
Yeah. You scatter some too, Suzy.

00:19:33.560 --> 00:19:38.900
About the dream you had... tenshi no katachi ni

00:19:38.900 --> 00:19:40.330
Thank you, Odelo.

00:19:40.360 --> 00:19:42.200
What are you talking about?
...which described the forms of angels tsumigiageta yume wo

00:19:42.200 --> 00:19:44.060
Mr. Oliver saw it, too.

00:19:44.060 --> 00:19:44.100
...which described the forms of angels tsumigiageta yume wo

00:19:44.100 --> 00:19:45.300
Saw what?

00:19:45.330 --> 00:19:48.330
The way you were shooting today, Miss Marbet. Right?

00:19:48.360 --> 00:19:53.430
Because the things we value most... taisetsu na mono wa sugu ni
That's right. We're prepared for stuff like that.

00:19:53.430 --> 00:19:56.160
Everyone's here. Let's start the funeral.

00:19:56.200 --> 00:19:58.960
...are so quickly broken kowareteshimau kara
Everyone, thank you so much.

00:19:58.960 --> 00:19:59.830
...are so quickly broken kowareteshimau kara

00:19:59.830 --> 00:20:01.800
Oh, me, too.

00:20:03.500 --> 00:20:04.530
Please tell me the prayers of the stars douka kikasete hoshitachi no inori wo

00:20:04.530 --> 00:20:06.100
They're out.

00:20:06.100 --> 00:20:06.130
Please tell me the prayers of the stars douka kikasete hoshitachi no inori wo

